+# Security Policy
+
+This project targets LAN deployments for ROS 2 developer boards. Still, please follow:
+
+## Authentication
+- Use **Nginx auth_request** or backend middleware as the gatekeeper.
+- On login success, set **HttpOnly + Secure + SameSite** cookies on the server side.
+- Do **not** persist access tokens in the frontend.
+
+## Transport
+- Prefer HTTPS when accessible (self-signed certs are OK in LAN with proper trust).
+
+## Rate limiting
+- Apply server-side throttling on `/api/auth/login`; return `429` with `Retry-After`.
+
+## File & Terminal APIs
+- Restrict upload paths and sanitize filenames.
+- Log and audit terminal access. Disable dangerous commands in production if possible.
+
+## Vulnerability reporting
+If you discover a vulnerability, please open a private report or contact the maintainer.
